Maintainer: Joffre Quintanilla <joffre.quintanilla@espoch.edu.ec>
Description: This package implements a custom continuous probability distribution (OwnFunction), including its probability density function (\eqn{f(x)}) and cumulative distribution function (\eqn{F(x)}). It also provides pseudo-random number generation using the inverse transform method and validates the results through chi-square goodness-of-fit test.
